    {
      "id": "claim_53b01b0950674ca3950a71ada1e5c104",
      "statement": "A half-adopted Vault, with some secrets in Vault and some in Komodo, is explicitly rejected as worse than either pure mechanism, because it reintroduces the dual-mechanism ambiguity ADR-0001 forbids; Vault was rejected as the core-stack backbone on the concrete cost that every host reboot brings it up sealed and blocks every deploy until a manual unseal.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/decisions/ADR-0001-prod-secrets-management.md#L36-L38",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:5aa91f39bc1aeefef124f6aa4bfa13193d2fac48a85cf7b8193160817c9b8c25:"
