    {
      "id": "claim_b398b16e198a4300953961009c833c84",
      "statement": "Per-user credential absence fails closed rather than falling back to a shared operator credential: the gateway's runtime_env actively removes an ambient ANTHROPIC_API_KEY when the run carries no per-user key, so an Ollama-only user can never reach the always-Claude escalation tier on an org key, and the escalation spec degrades to the base specialist.",
