      "id": "claim_296b19007c734096b836c42932cdaca0",
      "statement": "The CI guardrails workflow runs each named secrets gate with --selftest before the real scan, so a detector that silently stopped firing cannot report green: secret-scan (whole tree) and the naming job carrying the inline-secret, komodo-sync topology, whole-tree topology-scrub and argv-secret gates.",
