      "statement": "The whole-tree secret-scan knowingly applies to the generated openwiki/ bundle too: scripts/__tests__/leak-gate-coverage.test.mjs asserts that both secret-scan and the topology-scrub gate enumerate via git ls-files and that openwiki/ is not gitignored, so a wiki page cannot leak a credential or real topology past CI.",
