    {
      "id": "claim_953be7adcb544187a2dcc62eaccfbbe8",
      "statement": "AGENT_GATEWAY_CLIENT_SECRET is explicitly allowlisted by the inline-secret gate because the dev compose injects it with the optional ${VAR:-} form; in production it is mandatory and an empty value is fail-closed, making the RFC 8693 token re-exchange raise a configuration error rather than resolving to a shared default.",
