    {
      "id": "claim_d1f5afba7624428691b79cf1457ff8fa",
      "statement": "The dev secret generator is idempotent by design: a second run adds only keys the template has gained and leaves every existing value untouched so a running box keeps its credentials, whereas --force rotates every value and is therefore not a safe default for picking up one new variable.",
