      "id": "claim_f732403581024d1dbd74c80eac403bf7",
      "statement": "The committed placeholder templates are the only tracked members of otherwise-ignored env families: .gitignore ignores *.env and *.env.*, then negates stacks/*.env.example, **/*.env.prod.example, .env.deploy, and the agent gateway's .env.local.example specifically because that template is the only documented route to that gitignored file.",
      "evidence": [
